{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"When directly comparing the frequency domain spectra of Pre FoG-Turn and Pre Reg-Turn, however, no differences were found (Fig. 3B).\",\n    \"Numerically, Pre FoG-Turns displayed greater power (13-15 Hz) compared to Pre Reg-Turns, yet this did not reach statistical significance after correcting for multiple comparisons (P > 0.05).\",\n    \"Both Pre Reg-Turn (P = 0.018) and Pre FoG-Turn (P = 0.010) displayed significantly shortened burst durations compared to Standing.\",\n    \"Note that the reference used to evaluate significant differences is ‘Standing’ for neuronal parameters (rows 2-4) and Regular Walking for theta peak power (row 5), while kinematic contrasts (rows 6-7) were compared to Pre Reg-Turn.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"When directly comparing the frequency domain spectra of Pre FoG-Turn and Pre Reg-Turn, however, no differences were found (Fig. 3B).\",\n    \"We found a lack of low beta band desynchronization in the time-frequency domain in Pre FoG-Turns compared to Standing, while desynchronization of the high beta (non-parametric cluster-based permutation analysis: P = 0.002) and alpha bands was preserved (P = 0.006) (Fig. 2D).\",\n    \"In addition, kinematic analyses detected lower stride length in Pre FoG-Turns (Wilcoxon signed-rank test: P = 0.037) and lower stride velocity (P = 0.049) compared to Pre Reg-Turns (Fig. 1D).\",\n    \"Together with an increasing cadence in Pre FoG-Turns compared to Pre Reg-Turns (Wilcoxon signed-rank test: P = 0.037), this indicated a ‘sequence effect’ preceding FoG-Turns.18,66\",\n    \"Both Pre Reg-Turn (P = 0.018) and Pre FoG-Turn (P = 0.010) displayed significantly shortened burst durations compared to Standing.\",\n    \"Note that the reference used to evaluate significant differences is ‘Standing’ for neuronal parameters (rows 2-4) and Regular Walking for theta peak power (row 5), while kinematic contrasts (rows 6-7) were compared to Pre Reg-Turn.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"指控者的核心判断有全文依据。论文明确完成了Pre FoG-Turn与Pre Reg-Turn之间的频域谱直接比较，结果为未发现显著差异（Fig. 3B）；这不是尚未开展的研究。此外，论文还直接比较了两种转弯前状态的运动学指标，发现Pre FoG-Turn的步幅和步速显著降低、步频显著增加。因此，如果报告将两种条件之间的直接比较笼统地列为尚待开展的研究，确实遗漏了已经完成的直接比较及其阴性频域结果。不过，报告的说法评为partly而非no，是因为原文并未完成所有指标的两条件直接比较。例如，Pre FoG-Turn和Pre Reg-Turn的低beta时频变化主要分别与Standing基线比较；burst持续时间也分别与Standing比较，burst分布分析则主要比较各条件与Regular Walking。论文没有因此证明所有时频及burst指标均已完成Pre FoG-Turn与Pre Reg-Turn之间的直接比较。综上，报告关于仍需进一步研究的方向可以在限定具体指标后成立，但将两种条件的直接比较整体描述为尚未开展或尚待开展，缺少关键限定，并与论文已经完成的频域谱和运动学直接比较不符。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5ccd2bcf-7209-4e0d-9564-05429ff86919", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125521216915Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:56:15.114145+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2eedcecf1f86a9e0e0c91e3dccc41c192674b74fd579f262ec40d5aec9b2ec95", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6